{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f2be0535de1ec587c69cf08e2d2a165420b861591c1041f8621ca48f6995946e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae069f5408db1881b617a8719e91608c60e74070cf37e26b0724a2d7d122d66",
      "text": "各自的开端",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6ea179924b110a125f4535fe6c425aa824e902cd6b4220e420841a3a8088f10",
      "text": "观看歌舞伎演出后，桐生被翔真夺去了心魄。\n另一边，参与电视外景拍摄的翔真\n为自己未能出演主角而感到不甘。\n九郎听闻了新锐落语家桐生的传闻，\n开始重新思考自己该走的路。各自的开端。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae069f5408db1881b617a8719e91608c60e74070cf37e26b0724a2d7d122d66",
      "text": "各自的开端",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a94500cbc1876afc5a90fdf25e8eec85b711a786802edad1c631dd27a8c9cfc9",
      "text": "哎呀，真不错喵～。\n歌舞伎《弁天小僧》！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df4a313233a7d7f9213ea69ef4e52c5fb77c113e5453f41f98663b57ec2fde9",
      "text": "喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3710ef0a7bc61f8b63da33b216b76992ecfb8f47ca7cde2a84ad355920c10fac",
      "text": "虽然早就知道剧目喵，\n但亲眼目睹又是不一样的妙趣喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53ec45cd19ff3622ee02c68a2e5bbad0a1b8ead570fec84dd0c15451f05b6d78",
      "text": "感谢送戏票的老主顾喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e93860dd9d9878025b934cda96099af23e65ea3c8e5c2b28756cc60bd68949e",
      "text": "“要是不知便讲与你听”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb237942bcc3a1dbc9880fd97f50aaafc1558ff90c9fc88350504de243c3f21f",
      "text": "“弁天小僧菊之助正是老子我”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f81c2e1d6884efcc5b16cc95b2f6ae15338b37bc6bda84e231211d54ef29a964",
      "text": "接着，演员在这里摆开亮相架势！\n真是让人欲罢不能喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12790ddbc0567d4cfd528ac85e7ffa9018faf7852bcfd7232c9595d7d377ffc0",
      "text": "吾辈到现在还兴奋不已喵。\n喵喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5f0a3598822aa444305a6ab67cb366486c4b22d7842bdf1f75ed13f98339676",
      "text": "对了喵！\n今天还有意外的收获喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec1e1808690f587230d5c433411371d171b347dab6ba95c58cdc447628953eb",
      "text": "呜喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a54eafdc46e0a73493eb5167fe60344b0e75de331852c371d69ba7a0f7ac76c",
      "text": "主角的弁天小僧自不必说，\n还有另一个角色也让人很在意喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f970b4b578c6bbbeaae511d71182cd4e2a25fc4858ccceb45a5dd73c38514641",
      "text": "其实吾辈比起那个角色，\n更好奇饰演那个角色的演员喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fe2ea2e7b51949dc08b58f306ee3a64c590038b2853779111dfbb18bc90639f",
      "text": "如同蝴蝶一般翩翩起舞……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6435a273d56af15df103bc3130ae714efe2005736ee2ac014ac04e9c611a28ea",
      "text": "飘飘然～……根本移不开眼喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8655a554b0ffdb736de0d54de56eed17fe05abacf0785dc31c7f53c5e815b8ef",
      "text": "既能衬托主角，\n又能在自己的高光处大放异彩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72173858c0d77c22df41cf4a35b9909f747a723a9e9231e1fcbd25748f74a918",
      "text": "实在是太值得观察了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:935a5f5218eb0ae0ffe27e9036c451b1ae290ef58ce5c0317d66f3cfa2bae98c",
      "text": "那个演员的名字我记得好像是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:986671bb118475273a2a57f3444d1e565ea71beb7b04a95658fd43a24e02ba27",
      "text": "咦喵？\n想不起来了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:734f64c8caaab20d5f355f342115dd3923c0eefb54cc6da17ada92a7902764b5",
      "text": "光顾着沉迷于戏目，\n完全忘了去确认名字喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ec1e1808690f587230d5c433411371d171b347dab6ba95c58cdc447628953eb",
      "text": "呜喵……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:669c5c4a0a2caf5de3cc8166cce34405df35f1409d35f96453a2d4e9a7cd5dc7",
      "text": "喵喵？猫君，你打哈欠了喵？\n再听吾辈多讲讲喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73d8082bed66e18219cde52bd387b4a3adc3ab7e775a2f6c1b78d25cb2a01e1f",
      "text": "总之，是个非常好的观察对象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd5473cb97c2b9a4da7128215433217208dc7ec598cf4ec0a0888faeeabb1167",
      "text": "唔唔……！？叮——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4575c1e3fb988fa902e865dfd06c206da2c3a1b8695c78c68a48c8cb7da96f2c",
      "text": "吾辈的灵感降临了喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11967f8cd93d0dfdf2914d8db0213d7e16083a612cd868d5107f901a9ee544ef",
      "text": "多亏了蝴蝶先生，\n吾辈收获了绝妙的段子素材喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6cf3cf9e786ef7dff239fd96b40a1e020c5ae3c2d49f23f2f3e7a957214009c",
      "text": "把那个这样那样一下，\n三下五除二搅拌揉捏……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c8c0f35079bc28813d5e8aa8640b7de5086dbafed5c9ac37cb8be704ed46d9c",
      "text": "咕噜一转，当当当当！\n就能写出新作落语了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b9a0c3630c85bdbdaa943cdfb836a55cdca4e1cfabf5c4805370d762004bce8",
      "text": "这下连外星人都会吓一跳喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df4a313233a7d7f9213ea69ef4e52c5fb77c113e5453f41f98663b57ec2fde9",
      "text": "喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:190ec6b437258ffa930dab8dbf83e0b27137e35418c969e6827b5dce2f12d7d9",
      "text": "猫君也这么觉得喵！\n哎呀呀，真是得到了绝妙的启发喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e37dba23e9db29fcd70889bad15899301af84e6f97b0b7b32a0204535efe131b",
      "text": "必须得好好谢谢那位老主顾才行……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:782ec55241c6b3ee7a2b57daa5e3e36fce6bf4ce45d81b34fbdcd85a9b5abf0f",
      "text": "哎呀？\n猫君，睡着了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adf3af9931eeb3ee4a8556fd25d4e79457bef70c37f9d062a0b2e5425f2420ad",
      "text": "贪睡的小猫咪，在做着什么梦呢……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cea037a3f7c80ea06ca7f1af6fe735b75430c565e902bc843c3e85dd5e699a58",
      "text": "等新作落语写好了，\n第一个讲给猫君听喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a9d335d8c7affae95770144d6e14eaf795cbaa12df8d6fcba95ba358d726647",
      "text": "好啦，接下来会有什么样的相遇呢。\n走这条路感觉不错呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fabefb1d04966b0aeaa3fd4c169f5c80b5616aca578d710d5f53bbe297a8f2f",
      "text": "好，卡——！OK！\n我们要确认一下回放，稍微等一下哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd6fd7ae474fb2edbb33cfd752be7015b2f4f865d243f9053b314cb724ad98b",
      "text": "翔真先生，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01cc6500aaad01afdb743ef8771bf0f88a317bc367e7c359942ff313ab128d0b",
      "text": "辛苦啦。顺着性子走自己喜欢的路，\n也挺开心的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30f5488366fbf43c2ef52fde2aa7470c195cee266dde5e4e50be8cc2ee4f08fa",
      "text": "不知道前方会发生什么，\n就是这档散步节目的卖点所在嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc67f52e4939d9d266d0f84b32e89e3f6f524d0c7b84305fe7431d1db4fe3d5",
      "text": "话说回来，真没想到翔真先生会愿意\n来上我们的节目呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b452d163634cfde1ad3188175c91fb1ae4c23a1b1528c3876af738c7e8114c5",
      "text": "哎呀，这是为什么呀？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f87a19298918e47924711b499abb8bbb7e7e041ec54de38a0d3d0e6d1658dcdd",
      "text": "因为您在电视上可是炙手可热的红人啊！\n听说要敲定您的档期可费劲了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51cb3ea4b8e5b6fe17f1eb22ab0faa796a9008b0df253f39eac2a3be1ecc1d1c",
      "text": "呵呵，真是值得感激呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e09079835cda581f8b52b7025a97ef67ab3a200842711ddfdb78bb7e87e5618",
      "text": "（炙手可热，吗……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31344e1a8b1cbf088c82b2ba2ba9de66d06f48354cd601d806c6cb642159e05d",
      "text": "确认完毕了！\n过一会儿就要重新开拍咯——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e5df2c3b5afbf3a3cc995f2570e34c45c779cbb6abda75c1d3af65e36787e26",
      "text": "（无论在电视上多受欢迎，\n在歌舞伎的世界里都没有意义）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:424dae1023640f1d0a5fdbfb55fdd1ad889014d87a37837f6f125db920293822",
      "text": "（我没能演上弁天小僧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46aa40c9db8eac0b501a0886cea80bbcf39c55bca744785aa205cbfda023a5ec",
      "text": "（虽然早就明白这个道理……\n但在世袭制的世界里，出演主角的永远都是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b00c1d66ea0c25a5417d9ee1cfad3eff73f7b4299adfda6715aee7f1cd684db5",
      "text": "翔真先生——！要转场了哦！\n……翔真先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e09792c996b6e2b889458f90489210a0e8a4304b9422e9dfe13f9dd82d44d28",
      "text": "啊，抱歉。\n我都发呆了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d4ac388c52d04f952f2c916e1dccf4a9a8876298dceb443757ab5d093ccbd58",
      "text": "是不是太累了啊？\n毕竟是大红人嘛～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8abd7d117f8f1d72e34ed19c366f3734fe5b10630766ec46cb535a043be12335",
      "text": "呵呵，真会说话。\n不愧是当红的搞笑艺人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea7953eafd345d7e327b66b978dfdd9c08c03e42bc294086b8659d41f6bb3c1e",
      "text": "哈哈，这可真是被您将了一军啊～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b8c3e1d097ef3412627fdfe7a23b047fb41df5b69f1a678bd191c2acf03b25",
      "text": "（……工作的时候不该去想这些呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0964ea61a1f69a11bf87996effc5626ec9ee4348ce23a7813e74972c52a99011",
      "text": "（好，转换下心情。集中精力！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18a94b7e9e5bb6076c798dfeecb868eb43ee27d159762802585cc635ec8638e3",
      "text": "哎呀？好大的一座宅邸啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eec4bc8d1358b669d157ec36e52703b1d9802ba6e4ae1a7c44ab72fd3a5d6f54",
      "text": "喂，这里难道是……\n清澄家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e532987e54655eebd1297edc01d21482ab36dfee35a26fc1a316369736208dc0",
      "text": "说的清澄家，是那个茶道掌门人家吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:058df49d956faee2ebc7ec2e7fef3e8b50d85c4ebb9445602d8f20b6c25b987a",
      "text": "没错没错！哎呀——这可太厉害了！\n要是在庭院或者茶室里录制，能拍到很棒的画面啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b08c41e65aa788cf552ddb22c1bc9b7cdb1a70b4f8744ac06b2939fc9e5449ac",
      "text": "哦，要搞没有预约的突击探访吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dbb2c225e46ba6fb174ff102fe12ea6f6b5055b182398be64c875af75da021",
      "text": "我对谈判很有自信的！\n好啦，你们就瞧好吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:431fbb3788ea79bd1ba179b770c8180f4b4726df16e393a240ee61c55c38b400",
      "text": "哎呀，那就让我们见识见识你的本事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000047:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ecbb106b581309a9ae26d958e254ded7d489f1f946ea1189f8071b4bedf1dac",
      "text": "哎呀～……被一口回绝了！\n明明夸下海口，结果弄成这副德行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0432309414971f2925964bcd8e14da00797d52f5364f8994ac8c1a65a586237",
      "text": "嘛，这种事也是有的嘛。\n在下一个地方加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ebb861bd47cfd081a415fe51c32f86e3d491b7674522631ada6b09db3862afa",
      "text": "那么我们换地方咯——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2af91b8d68b57179a0cc23b21dc1398c17b46b2bc508c76c809046fe4eff4fe8",
      "text": "（不知道前方会发生什么，\n倒也确实刺激又有趣呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbe2f9422cbc87e68fb9a7c3384680681e95efd483d8e4f823d76bb7d094a087",
      "text": "（虽然没能拜访清澄家有点可惜。\n哎呀，有车开过来了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81f0e11a471a4fd40e43c1c7ebce2d2203caaf57600afa045ec09f0682e0ce68",
      "text": "翔真先生！来了一辆好厉害的车哦！\n下来的是这里的学生吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334178464f4c6642db2927d967eb8d10a729ab226482b93d32244efb7e70df40",
      "text": "（一直盯着看不太礼貌呢。\n不过，真是一个引人注目的孩子啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c12061ee630ab0802e7aa9e4fd5e72443b3440100f98e54948c9105af36494b",
      "text": "（那种沉稳的气质与高雅的仪态……\n肯定不是普通学生吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13b010beedff66163841dc475ffad3632e61adce7c0f1a4fd5e12ab1f2b4a52c",
      "text": "（我记得清澄家应该有两位少爷才对。\n是其中一位吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff3c040a48abefb6821cbace6f2026d59731e8dc100846c9383ad2f89931838",
      "text": "啊，他好像注意到我们了！\n正在朝这边低头行礼……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:872c7e20a1d5f34a385602faa3cfdb43746e13b587a3bf42aadf4220311416d4",
      "text": "哎呀，行礼的姿态真漂亮。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_g:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d835a33d97a42a3d382a6f27840026f131113a02f9224e786707116c3bd62d9d",
      "text": "（面对任何人都不失礼仪……\n真是个好孩子呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17202d8b79e9e51ff11968dd1dd1f10dda38725a6ffbc16867155c67967bb89",
      "text": "社交酒会",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a053cff848a96b9a3aa580c3ea0557bf0ce9facdafcc844f511c7c44a2e7790c",
      "text": "（为什么我非得参加\n这场酒会不可呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c73067af6acc493a92e63502eaf2dacfdf4b18158302e9c7175cce81a45a1acb",
      "text": "（虽说是因为父亲和兄长抽不出空，\n但祖父也未免太强人所难了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93f022e76ac2ecbb8e368911b11c0b8a5c3fde7108495972a64f3973a7d57ab2",
      "text": "（眼下本就因为继承人问题和长老们的干预\n而纷扰不断……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6699139d3caddf675ff1947a3fba12c405ef27de97909f7a03a1da87ec2e3294",
      "text": "……这种场合，我果然还是无法习惯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b7ae275b75d4f6252545d1069caca9d7237f19b671dc41efdbc8d7c73e7ed67",
      "text": "原来你在这里啊，九郎！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0604bcf54d55ef2a6f502b893a075c33ade35e62bf621b1aeb6508b3f53950",
      "text": "祖父。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7174241d45d6615e747a42f90b273fad2a0bc05e090e4b189940187e9ba03954",
      "text": "去四处打个招呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_h:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ad3deb5a8c13cc97397951f83289b49aed3433b3f86a166ecc6bc582e1e96d4",
      "text": "……好的，我明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:528173b6ed9d8528911d2f6bc098bc6d4de9cfad0329c81c158f6b6f93f9041a",
      "text": "初次见面。\n家祖承蒙各位一直以来的关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b20a8d3f21bdc37dbd949febf8a4e9377a4f1e5fc8b0a1e96b79482c116177f",
      "text": "是的，托大家的福。\n今后也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6015af5330732d0206658a6df348771fda22c249face795b86e87727d95945c2",
      "text": "（不管和谁说话，都是大同小异的客套……\n虽然在这样的场合也是无可奈何）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6eb8ef519abcd7b997d501da855d5083644c0f54e90dc1d41ead314eb134b7c",
      "text": "那么老师。\n改日我们定当再次登门相邀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b656d904357dc0a31dc43a25ca403b505a88ffb6d73f3a5f170db5257788ce",
      "text": "（祖父邀请的人，也总是固定那几位。\n我明明希望让更多的人接触到茶道）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fc6dc4833588528893864e24637ec64e077ab01d6611c545e7e58b1afe9d91c",
      "text": "哎呀，真是好久不见了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f2c4f3c5b98edfabaffac524bf559411255133dbf341d834d0e6f49c365971",
      "text": "（这位我记得是，落语家的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:789a4e1a96f492b271b569f238f268b66a1f0656f94a808a0c3b492251f8bd18",
      "text": "最近如何啊？近来可好？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24a7b65b9614598a2c070a3dc0075f5f5e704c8d8a5879e36c17a7743a8423d8",
      "text": "最近有个挺有意思的小家伙呢。\n对了，年纪大概和九郎君差不多吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe36b46c45fc7e1c3a1e5ef7a90eb0ef28f63778701bdf9239d8393227af64e4",
      "text": "有个孩子以破纪录的速度晋升到了二目呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_i:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d106c248c3f7702d1a0e60fda1e9cf1cfb06422ecc82e6471bea92ce1398a58",
      "text": "（哎……和我差不多的年纪，就升到了二目……！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbcdcb8db136e91419b6ee3f5b16ae97c56983f240e6b7aecd063691c68b5620",
      "text": "（即便是不太熟悉落语的我，也明白）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43f4257e38f43d83d4b9993cb746e7e626db26a8bc387321ffbeb0a6b7da9c7a",
      "text": "（要成为二目，究竟有多么困难……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af483d1df61b8980d8246017e28893d7860d25743c5ebe67d50cc44473ca4a9b",
      "text": "（到底是一位怎样的人物呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad520a4c8cd2deb487b936f7bf161aded3021aa2eda6ccb62bc931385c9a85f4",
      "text": "嚯……据说还有提拔晋升真打的传闻。\n那确实是“破例”了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd9ff261cdcc139f1052ecf6860c5adc7aa5cfe9f9aee5fcf819a1c44b12b54e",
      "text": "是啊，他可是“破格的天才”呢。\n毕竟他每天都在挑战新事物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07d6604d350470164e7a0e5886315146890911373db5c232ba4d732972e078e5",
      "text": "挑战，新事物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2aa4065f77467b34e21a27cefdc99bd065155b1fe362c1deacbb07ee9b08df7",
      "text": "（……我也曾多次违背过重视传统与名誉的\n祖父的意愿）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a88b3e6d35593639a120ca963d5be99f041cb187d02047a747c1a53684bb690",
      "text": "（接受杂志的采访，回应专访。\n被人捧为“茶道贵公子”之类的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0184cbc3ac43a92efa2add2b0d05d324f90ad4077c2065f402c2ceed3609ed2",
      "text": "（虽然也曾觉得烦琐，\n但这一切都是为了让大家对茶道产生兴趣）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0256740216f8b28f622fdcf60e9d2bd3c16cfddf1f93fd31823e2c1ee698bf9",
      "text": "（……但是，\n真的只要这样就够了吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_01_1_1_007_01:1_1_007_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c85c8a8f558211d20ae21247ed7114457ba454c9cdf79663e4779b65615a20",
      "text": "（是否还有其他，是我能够去挑战的\n新事物呢……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
